  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Perri Bishop is an American finance executive who served as chief operating officer of Impala Asset Management. A history graduate of Muhlenberg College, she joined the firm after a long career serving hedge-fund clients in senior equity sales. Based in Palm Beach, she is married to Impala’s founder, Robert Bishop.",
    "html": "<p>Perri Bishop is an American finance executive who served as chief operating officer of Impala Asset Management. A history graduate of Muhlenberg College, she joined the firm after a long career serving hedge-fund clients in senior equity sales. Based in Palm Beach, she is married to Impala’s founder, Robert Bishop.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 50,
