  "long_biography": {
    "plain_text": "At Barclays Capital, Perri Bishop combined client work with programmes for colleagues. She organised senior mentoring, round-table discussions and women’s networking groups. Her commercial responsibilities included managing the bank’s Alpha Capture initiative for hedge-fund clients, alongside work with the bank’s research, trading and prime-brokerage teams.\n\nHer charitable giving with her husband supported the University of Southern California’s Bloom Football Performance Center. Bishop described sport’s ability to bring people together as a reason for their commitment. Their gift helped fund a centre designed around player development, with practice fields, recovery facilities, nutrition support and sports-science services for student-athletes.",
    "html": "<p>At Barclays Capital, Perri Bishop combined client work with programmes for colleagues. She organised senior mentoring, round-table discussions and women’s networking groups. Her commercial responsibilities included managing the bank’s Alpha Capture initiative for hedge-fund clients, alongside work with the bank’s research, trading and prime-brokerage teams.</p>\r\n<p>Her charitable giving with her husband supported the University of Southern California’s Bloom Football Performance Center. Bishop described sport’s ability to bring people together as a reason for their commitment. Their gift helped fund a centre designed around player development, with practice fields, recovery facilities, nutrition support and sports-science services for student-athletes.</p>\r\n",
